Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.33,0:00:04.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.41,0:00:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到撂倒路西法的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find a way to beat the devil, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你们引诱路西法到牢笼边 而我跳进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you guys lead the devil to the edge and I jump in?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆早不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在有什么打算呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you are gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,回天堂吧 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to heaven, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于米迦勒也被关进了牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Michael in the cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必此刻上面必定是一片混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it's total anarchy up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢 现在你是老大了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you're the new sheriff in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面正在进行内战\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Civil War up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.53,0:00:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能打败拉斐尔 我们就可以结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can beat Raphael, we can end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦油燃烧起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the oil burns,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有天使敢触碰或是跨过那火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}no angel can touch or pass through the flames,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是活得不耐烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵魂 不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his soul. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.97,0:00:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们这些怪物死掉时 我们该魂归何处呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we freaks die, where do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不上天堂 也不入地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not heaven, not hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 炼狱 - 而我想得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Purgatory. - And I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.70,0:00:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的灵魂远比你想象的珍贵得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human soul is more valuable than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了那些灵魂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about the souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.55,0:00:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔萨泽为了增加你们的战斗力\N{\fnArial\fs30}That angel went and created.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变历史来徒增了五万灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}50, 000 new souls for your war machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.94,0:00:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏娃 万物之母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eve, the mother of all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.03,0:01:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只想要克劳力的命 - 那么恐怕你来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Crowley I want dead. - Well, you're too late there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小英国佬早在数月前被燃烧殆尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little limey mook roasted months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.51,0:01:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Cass…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.17,0:01:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情变得越来越荒唐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is getting ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想要我帮你擦几次屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times am I gonna have to clean up your messes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:16.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来 我已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.63,0:01:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经生存了很长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been here for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的林林总总都还历历在目\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.05,0:01:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得在一个海岸边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember being at a shoreline,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现一只正在努力往岸上扑腾的小灰鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching a little gray fish heave itself up on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.74,0:01:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个年长的兄弟对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an older brother saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别踩到那条鱼 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't step on that fish, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条鱼还大有用处呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big plans for that fish."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:02:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得巴别塔 37英尺高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember the tower of Babel… all 37 feet of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在当时来说 算是惊骇世俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I suppose was impressive at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当它倒塌时 他们叫喊着神降天谴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it fell, they howled divine wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.47,0:02:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}But come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,干粪筑的墙壁也就只能堆那么高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dried dung can only be stacked so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得该隐和亚伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember Cain and Abel…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫和歌利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}David and Goliath…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所多玛和蛾摩拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sodom and Gomorrah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得最非凡的那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember the most remarkable event …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,之所以非比寻常是因为从未发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remarkable because it never came to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止天启降世的是两个小哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was averted by two boys…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个老酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old drunk…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个堕落天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a fallen angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,荡气回肠的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grand story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.11,0:02:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们颠覆了结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we ripped up the ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛开了一切规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rules…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}And destiny…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅将自由和选择权紧握于手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving nothing but freedom and choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:03:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都尽如人意 除了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is all well and good, except…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我做的选择是错误的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Well, what if I've made the wrong choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该如何自知呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些本末倒置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting ahead of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来讲述我的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你这一切的原委\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第20集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好得很 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.05,0:03:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想来打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanted to check in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于小恶魔的死活 有什么消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, any word on, uh, Satan jr. being alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 还在查 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…Looking, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想不通 克劳力是怎么骗到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't understand how Crowley could've tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他是个诡计多端的混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's a tricky son of a bitch, that's how.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果他真的活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he is up and kicking,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的要找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}then what does matter is finding him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拧掉他的脑袋 爆他的菊\N{\fnArial\fs30}ripping his head off, and shoving it up his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们呢 有什么收获没\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? Have you found anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.24,0:04:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 还没任何发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙乎着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's keeping busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.27,0:04:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会儿他正在奥马哈追踪一个灯灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's tracking a djinn in Omaha as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我正要去跟他汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I'm heading out there right now to meet up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以的话我会跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd come if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I-I get it. No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.41,0:04:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你会来找我们的 对吧小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Cass, you'll call, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你遇上什么大麻烦的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get into real trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有何收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,收获颇丰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've found a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏娃的大脑已经彻底死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eve's brain? Dead as a tinned kipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…出于某种原因…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for some reason…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她仍在一直产卵\N{\fnArial\fs30}She keeps laying eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.49,0:05:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小吸血鬼能感应到每一次触碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocula here feels every tickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:05:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that good for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了让人感到性奋之外 我就不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from the obvious erotic value, you got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过夏娃能够开启炼狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said Eve could open the door to purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我的确说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我相信 如果她还活着的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm confident that she could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能已经把门打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she was still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是帮我们达成目的的最佳人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Single best chance to get over the rainbow,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果温氏兄弟却把她给杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Winchesters killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.21,0:06:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时局势不受控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你太不给力了 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You screwed up, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你任由猎狗咬死了野鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let the hounds mangle the pheasant,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,到头来还要我去收拾烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now I am up to my elbows in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.51,0:06:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你分心了 这让我很担忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're distracted, and that makes me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在履行我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am holding up my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你还办了点别的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is that all you're holding?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}See…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的外套上沾满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stench of that impala's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆黑斑羚的恶臭 天使大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all over your overcoat, angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.03,0:06:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是说好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we'd agreed …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.12,0:06:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不去找他们兄弟俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more nights out with the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是跟迪恩聊了几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spoke with Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.63,0:06:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要随时掌握他们手上的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to know what they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪方面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我的事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}About me, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我有足够的理由相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I happen to have it on good authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那两只小宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your two little pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近正卯足了劲想抓我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}are currently trying to hunt me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我的直白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我认为你在此事上大概有点利益冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think you might have a little conflict of interest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力所言极是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley had a point, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的利益的确发生了冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}My interest was conflicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然把自己当做温氏兄弟的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still considered myself the Winchesters' guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们教会了我如何抵抗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}they taught me how to stand up…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Ass butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.77,0:07:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…为何而奋斗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what to stand for…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.87,0:07:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及在抵抗和奋斗过后通常会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what generally happens to you when you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.83,0:07:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命终结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来最不可思议的事情发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the most extraordinary thing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我竟然复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was put back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我们取得了胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we had won.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:08:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止了世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stopped armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.49,0:08:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却代价惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at a terrible cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我知道了自己接下来的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I knew what I had to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再度前往地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again, I went to harrow hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,将萨姆从路西法的牢笼中解救了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to free Sam from Lucifer's cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个几乎不可能完成的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was nearly impossible,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我心中充满了自信与使命感\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was so full of confidence, of mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在看来 那只是自负…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see now that was arrogance…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和傲慢罢了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}hubris…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.45,0:08:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我并没有真正地将萨姆复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, of course, I hadn't truly raised Sam …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是完整的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:09:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我们很幸运 能够得到告诫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes we're lucky enough to be given a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这本应是给我的告诫\N{\fnArial\fs30}This should have been mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.13,0:09:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你了 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了温氏兄弟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kill the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我只能亲自动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你杀了他们 我也会把他们救回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you kill them, I'll just bring them back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方连你都无能为力 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not where I'll put 'em. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said…no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必担心他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必担心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.75,0:09:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道路西法不担心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like Lucifer didn't worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,米迦勒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝 阿拉斯泰尔和阿撒兹勒不担心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Lilith or Alistair or Azazel didn't worry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道在这场战局里只有我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the only game piece on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没低估那两个穿牛仔裤的温家双煞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who doesn't underestimate those denim-wrapped nightmares?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.87,0:09:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你专心找炼狱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just find purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你找不到 我们俩都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't, we will both die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不停地经历死亡 直到时间的尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}again and again, until the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟找不到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters won't get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们来找我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them get to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.83,0:10:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把他们的心挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tear their friggin' hearts out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 瑞德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you, Redd…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于一个猥琐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a filthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,低贱至极的再生侠来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}lower-than-snake-spit hellspawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.13,0:10:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒是成了一个像模像样的猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to have turned yourself into a damn fine hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道是要杀了你还是亲亲你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know whether to kill you or kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please, kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.85,0:10:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你摧毁了在天鹅谷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you that dug out that nest of vamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼巢穴 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}back in Swan Valley, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次搞定八个 捆绑结实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight of 'em in one go, roped and tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你送他们到克劳力那 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you brought them to Crowley, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凹凸了 乡巴佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read the papers, redneck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.26,0:10:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.89,0:10:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的举动就证明了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You prove it just by being,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个可怜又愚蠢的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}you poor, dumb jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力还活着 他的势力仍遍布天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's alive. His nets are still out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.17,0:11:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是现在他是用你们这些笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except now he's using you schmucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来替他抓捕怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hunt his monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redd…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.68,0:11:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么享受一下这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, hang on to this for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你都给他说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what'd you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the hubbub?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到小卡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:11:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时前他飞进我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He popped in on me about two hours back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:11:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给他说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他我们在追捕一些怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told him we were on some crap monster hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道我们在接近克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know that we're getting close to Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he's our friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们竟然对他信口雌黄\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are lying to him through our teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.82,0:12:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 他就是烧错骨头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean… - So he burned the wrong bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是克劳力耍了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Crowley tricked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他简直就一个小天真\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the Balki Bartokomous of heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有可能出错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can make a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.35,0:12:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在谁都没说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's saying nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为小卡和克劳力是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that Cass is in with Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我只是说我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just saying I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都恨自己有这样的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, I hate myself for even thinking it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.99,0:12:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.11,0:12:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他也是我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, he's our friend, too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为他而死 真的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd die for him. I would, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望咱们是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm praying we're wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果我们没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we ain't…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果哪怕有一点点可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's a snowball of a snowball's chance here…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就意味着我们得对抗一个黑化的超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that means we're dealing with a superman who's gone dark side…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.23,0:12:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说我们得小心谨慎\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means we've got to be cautious,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,得心思敏捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got to be smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还得储存些氪石（超人的克星）\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe stock up on some kryptonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:13:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就是超人的「女人」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This makes you Lois Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.87,0:13:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次解决一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, one problem at a time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在那个混蛋克劳力打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find Crowley now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那见鬼的炼狱前找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the damn fool cracks open purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经开始怀疑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they already suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.99,0:13:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克劳力在哪 - 去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Crowley? - Up yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.89,0:13:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,最糟糕的部分就是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the worst part was Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他非常努力地想相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was trying so hard to be loyal,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的直觉告诉他并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}but every instinct telling him otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.73,0:13:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道克劳力在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where Crowley is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可有的是时间折磨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we can twist again all the way to next summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never even met him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不和克劳力直接打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't deal with Crowley direct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你和谁打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who do you deal with?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.99,0:13:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,调度员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dispatcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫埃尔斯沃思的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon named Ellsworth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有个恶魔和鲍比做的工作一样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was a demon counterpart to Bobby Singer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:14:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,非埃尔斯沃思莫属\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellsworth would be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你去新墨西哥州\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to get down to New Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把那个雪怪抓过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bag me that wendigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.41,0:14:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为老大说我们用不着他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the boss says we're done with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局 我是托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI. Thomas speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.35,0:14:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是我派去的 谢谢来电确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely, I sent them. Thank you for calling to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你过的愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice day, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要放在这里 你们个二货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in here, you friggin' yeti.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.71,0:14:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,放后面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些恶魔会带领温家兄弟找到克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}These demons would lead the Winchesters to Crowley,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力会把他俩杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Crowley would tear their hearts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了保护温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it to protect the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是保护我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己都糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面啥也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Clear from the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.73,0:15:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔得到线报然后撤退了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons get tipped and bugged out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们在躲我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they run from us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,想法不错 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that would be a nice thought, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是真的就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,欺骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.89,0:15:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweeping away evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.99,0:15:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的动机曾经很单纯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my motives used to be so pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「救」了萨姆之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After supposedly "saving" Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于回到了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally returned to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 天堂不止一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, there isn't one heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.51,0:16:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个灵魂都有自己的天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each soul generates its own paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那个1953年溺死在浴缸中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I favored the eternal Tuesday afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个孤僻的男人创造的永恒的星期二下午\N{\fnArial\fs30}of an autistic man who drowned in a bathtub in 1953.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.97,0:16:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 我们亲眼看见路西法杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, we saw Lucifer destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那路西法和米迦勒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Lucifer? Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是上帝 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was God, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.55,0:16:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们阻止了天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}They brought down the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你打败了大天使 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you beat the Archangels, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝把你救了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}God brought you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西 他选择了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chose you, Cass…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来领导我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:16:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没人领导我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one leads us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以自己做决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all free to make our own choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.20,0:17:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择我们自己的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to choose our own fates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝意在何为\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does god want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝想让你们自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}God wants you to have freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用自由来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what does he want us to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我那时知道现在明白的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I knew then what I know now…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might have said…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由是一截绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Freedom is a length of rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝想让你们用自由之绳上吊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God wants you to hang yourself with it."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到天堂的头几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those first weeks back in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,日子异常地艰辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}were surprisingly difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.83,0:17:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,向天使们解释自由之说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explaining freedom to angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是对牛弹琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a bit like teaching poetry to fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后拉斐尔出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there was Raphael…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.13,0:17:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很欣赏你的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate the courage that takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个天堂是谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose heaven is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯莱的（安然公司创始人） 我借来用用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ken Lay's. I'm borrowing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是怀疑他是否够资格进入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still question his admittance here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很虔诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's devout.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,压倒了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trumps everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我号召了众天使集结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've called for a full assembly of the holy host.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在我面前跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kneel before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.21,0:18:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后宣誓效忠 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pledge allegiance to the flag, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,效忠谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what flag is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣誓效忠于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allegiance to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来像开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like I'm joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.14,0:18:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来都一副面瘫脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never look like you're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了上帝 天堂和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rebelled … against God, heaven, and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要赎罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you will atone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先把路西法和米迦勒从牢笼里释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start by freeing Lucifer and Michael from their cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们再继续上演好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we'll get our show back on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.24,0:18:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斐尔 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael…No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有必要费尽心思开启天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse doesn't have to be fought!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.43,0:18:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然必要 那是上帝的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it does. It's god's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这就是我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.85,0:18:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的天使不会任你恣意妄为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the other angels won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:19:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里最清楚不过了 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know better than anyone, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.44,0:19:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们生来就要听命 不是为自由而造\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't built for freedom. They were built to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我便会出面阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈及我的兄长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not ashamed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.55,0:19:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,将我修理的很惨 我不觉羞愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my big brother knocked me into next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你会向我臣服 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow you kneel, Castiel…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.45,0:19:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你及你的随从都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you and anyone with you dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place is clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没错 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,未免也太干净了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like "Mr. Clean" clean, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.45,0:19:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟普通恶魔相比 这简直就算强迫症了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of OCD for your average demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:19:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.97,0:20:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd call Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.19,0:20:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.75,0:20:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我们都会在这种时候叫小卡来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is usually the point where we would call Cass for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经谈过这事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.57,0:20:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 都是你们在说 我只是在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you talked. I listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是小卡啊 两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Cass, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 当我们孤立无援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, when there was no one…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.89,0:20:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法逃脱 真的陷入困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we were stuck … and I mean really stuck …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他挺身而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}he broke ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.97,0:20:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为我们两肋插刀上刀山下火海\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has gone to the mat cut and bleeding for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道有他妈多少回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so many freakin' times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是小卡啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没证据之前 我们至少应该相信他的清白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't we owe him the benefit of the doubt at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.51,0:20:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.13,0:20:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is really important, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.77,0:20:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… We really need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.06,0:20:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧出现吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.38,0:20:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't go to them…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.57,0:20:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道他们拥有我无法作答的疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I knew they would have questions I couldn't answer…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.17,0:21:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我们也很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right. We are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,又回到起点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我们现在怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Well, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们抓到过一个恶魔猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we caught one hunter demon before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还能再抓到的 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can do it again. - Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.59,0:21:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力向你问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley says "Hi".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.89,0:21:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力派出了他的得力干将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley sent his very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也跟那三人一样惊讶万分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was caught as much by surprise as the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.55,0:21:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而我尚有其它选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it left me with yet another choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以现身处理那些恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could reveal myself and smite the demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.28,0:21:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 那一定不讨克劳力的喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Crowley wouldn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.79,0:21:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可话又说回来 他们是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But on the other hand, they were my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一刹那间\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a brief moment…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又做回了我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.72,0:22:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is good to see you, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.79,0:22:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.71,0:22:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真及时啊 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect timing, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴我找到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有消息告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come with news.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.03,0:22:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.73,0:22:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信克劳力还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I firmly believe Crowley is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.37,0:22:34.21,Title,0,0,0,0,,是啊 还用你说吗 酷杰克（出自《神探酷杰克》）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You think, Kojak?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.20,0:22:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 关于小卡再次救了我们的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Bobby, what do we think about Cass saving our asses…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.71,0:22:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,该作何感想呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.58,0:22:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该给你道个歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.13,0:22:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段时间我们都在追捕克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been hunting Crowley this whole time…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.37,0:22:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞒着不让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keeping it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.85,0:22:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.27,0:22:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在跟他合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were working with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.23,0:22:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.39,0:23:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 疯了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.13,0:23:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你烧错了尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that you torched the wrong bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.21,0:23:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不重要 我们 错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter. We … we were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.81,0:23:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.94,0:23:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,本可直问无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could've just asked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.44,0:23:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是应该那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.43,0:23:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不应该对你有所怀疑 那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never should've doubted you. It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能原谅我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope you can forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.88,0:23:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是奇事不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonders never cease.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.10,0:23:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们再度信任我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They trusted me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.08,0:23:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这只是另一个谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was just another lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.97,0:23:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.86,0:23:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是有点荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a little absurd, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.29,0:23:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑化版的超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman going to the dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.56,0:23:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是卡西迪奥啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still just Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以把氪星石扔一边了 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we can put away the kryptonite, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.61,0:23:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.62,0:23:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我当时没有意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I didn't realize it at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.06,0:23:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.94,0:23:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那一刻 就那样结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right then, just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.02,0:24:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟派恶魔去杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent demons after them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.47,0:24:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我的猎人 我怎么就不能杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill my hunters. Why can't I kill yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.06,0:24:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.70,0:24:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能拥有朋友 再也不能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't have friends, not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.72,0:24:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 你要失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, my God. You're losing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.38,0:24:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是心理健康的代言人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the very picture of mental health.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.09,0:24:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你以为我不知道这都为了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You don't think I know what this is all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.53,0:24:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.58,0:24:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,弥天大谎 温氏兄弟还相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big lie, the Winchesters still buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.98,0:24:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你是好小卡 正直的小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good Cass, the righteous Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.75,0:24:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们还相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}And long as they still believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.36,0:24:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就也相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get to believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.01,0:24:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我得告诉你 小乖乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got news for you, kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.81,0:24:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当了婊子就别想人家给你立牌坊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whore is a whore is a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.73,0:24:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话我只说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only gonna say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.86,0:24:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢动他们一根毫毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you touch a hair on their heads,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.95,0:24:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就毁掉一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tear it all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.67,0:24:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的约定 所有一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our arrangement, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.62,0:24:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是个天使呢 我会灭了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still an angel, and I will bury you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.04,0:24:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扪心自问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.71,0:24:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我跟这种下三滥在一起干嘛」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What was I doing with this vermin?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫哪门子合作啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not how synergy works!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.61,0:25:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我很清楚是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if I didn't already know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.34,0:25:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斐尔比我强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael was stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.57,0:25:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬碰硬我是赢不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't survive a straight fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.30,0:25:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我去找老朋友帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I went to an old friend for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.22,0:25:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是当我看着他 却停了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But watching him, I stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.28,0:25:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他牺牲了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything he sacrificed,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.78,0:25:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却还要向他要求更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was about to ask him for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.87,0:25:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.78,0:25:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期四天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel of Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.37,0:25:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜今天不归你管 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not your day is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.74,0:25:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.01,0:25:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了帮我们俩一个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to help you help me help ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.59,0:25:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拐弯抹角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.66,0:25:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想来谈一笔简单的交易 没别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to discuss a simple business transaction. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.85,0:25:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to make a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.50,0:25:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.74,0:25:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个天使 你个二货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel, you ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.75,0:25:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有灵魂能卖给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a soul to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.23,0:25:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那就是问题的关键 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's it, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.58,0:25:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是全部的关键 灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all of it. It's the souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.50,0:25:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到底就是灵魂 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all comes down to the souls in the end, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.03,0:26:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说如何灭掉拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about Raphael's head on a pike.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.77,0:26:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说我们所有人的欢乐大结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about happy endings for all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.59,0:26:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,各方面的欢乐大结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all possible entendres intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.97,0:26:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.52,0:26:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.22,0:26:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有兴趣跟你谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no interest in talking with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.07,0:26:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛不呢 人家很风趣滴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? I'm very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.65,0:26:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛 听我说完的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.68,0:26:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就五分钟 免费的哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes. No obligations.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.29,0:26:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 不会浪费你的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise, I'll make it worth your while.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.37,0:26:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.19,0:26:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道克劳力是什么人物 他做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew who Crowley was and what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.72,0:26:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我比他聪明 比他强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was smarter than him, stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.17,0:26:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在知道我是太自大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see now that I was prideful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.29,0:26:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且很有可能 我就是个傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in all likelihood, I was a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.06,0:26:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.24,0:26:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,认不出了 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't recognize it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.27,0:27:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是冥府 新升级版的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hades, new and improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.91,0:27:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己做的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.47,0:27:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.97,0:27:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你看 老地方的毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. See, problem with the old place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.21,0:27:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大部分的犯人就是受虐狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}was most of the inmates were masochists already.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.73,0:27:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是有人说 谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of "Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.61,0:27:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再多来根红热的棍子捅捅我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have another hot spike up the jacksie?"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.26,0:27:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你看看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.39,0:27:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人喜欢排队\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one likes waiting in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.81,0:27:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们排到了会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happens when they reach the front?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.67,0:27:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.75,0:27:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次回到队尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}They go right back to the end again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.43,0:27:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,效率很高吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.19,0:27:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还剩四分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have four minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.62,0:27:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么对付拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you planning to do about Raphael?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.22,0:27:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了屈服或者死 我还能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do besides submit or die?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.05,0:27:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,屈服或死 你以为你是法国人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Submit or die? What are you, French?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.97,0:27:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不对着干\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about resist?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.51,0:27:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道 我没他强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not strong enough, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.12,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人是不够强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, not on your own, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.74,0:27:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是一个人啊 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not on your own, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.26,0:27:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有许多天使欣赏你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of angels swooning over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.87,0:27:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,「上帝的宠儿」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"God's favorite."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.85,0:27:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你在他们眼中可是很有魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy boy, you've got what they call sex appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.55,0:27:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 有话直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.28,0:27:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们需要领袖 这个人就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels need leaders, so be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.52,0:27:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合你的人马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather your army.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.80,0:28:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,铲除所有巴结拉斐尔的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kick the candy out of each and every angel that shows up for Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想说服我在天堂发起内战么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you proposing that I start a civil war in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.30,0:28:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了哟 告诉他奖品是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ding! Ding! Ding! Tell him what he's won, Vanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.69,0:28:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想让我成为下一个路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking me to be the next Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.11,0:28:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.14,0:28:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法缺乏父爱而且有暴力倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer was a petulant child with daddy issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.14,0:28:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你爱上帝 上帝也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you love god. God loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.27,0:28:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他将你复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得他这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it occur to you that maybe he did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.63,0:28:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是想让你成为新的领袖么\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you could be the new sheriff upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.78,0:28:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.76,0:28:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动战争所需的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the amount of power that it would take.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.68,0:28:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太过强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}to mount a war…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.99,0:28:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要史无前例强大的力量 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than either of us have ever seen, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.43,0:28:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是如果我说我知道如何拥有最强力量呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if I said I knew how to go nuclear?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.35,0:28:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.68,0:28:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱呀 我可爱的小翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory, my fine feathered friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.38,0:28:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.45,0:28:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,试想一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.60,0:28:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个未开发过的油井\N{\fnArial\fs30}An untapped oil well of.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.56,0:28:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面全是张牙舞爪的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}every fanged, clawed soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.45,0:28:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想 这些年来有多少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what's that over the years?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.89,0:28:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,三千万还是四千万呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 million? 40 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.77,0:29:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那 饱满丰富 供人拿取\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sitting there, plump and rich for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.60,0:29:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然以前没人找到 你怎么就能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you even find it when no one ever has?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.50,0:29:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要专业的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need expert help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.25,0:29:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}From whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.39,0:29:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是专家啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}From experts, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.59,0:29:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有两个奇奇怪怪的年轻人十分合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know of two eerily suited teen beat models.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.18,0:29:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且有大把时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}with time on their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.96,0:29:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 迪恩不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.66,0:29:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经退出了 不能把他扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's retired, and he's to stay that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.41,0:29:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.70,0:29:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还有个秃顶的老家长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I know of a certain big, bald patriarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.17,0:29:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以做候补人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take off the bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.15,0:29:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.84,0:29:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能帮我们找到那些怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can get us to the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.73,0:29:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些怪物可以带我们找到炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monsters can get us to purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.87,0:29:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.24,0:29:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做的话 你的代价是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's your price in all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.08,0:29:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 仅仅一半 - 一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just half. - Half?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.04,0:29:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的地位没那么稳定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My position isn't all that stable, ducky.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.46,0:29:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些灵魂能帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those souls would help,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.99,0:29:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样也能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like they'd help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.09,0:29:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 难道你不想让我掌管地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, wouldn't you rather have me in charge down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.45,0:29:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法可没这么好伺候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.83,0:29:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.14,0:29:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的计划时间太长 我现在就需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your plan would take months, and I need help now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.01,0:29:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.58,0:29:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.94,0:30:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为了向你展现我对此次计划的决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just to show you how serious I am about this scheme…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.87,0:30:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先借你一些怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about I float you a little loan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.26,0:30:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如50大群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, 50 large?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.46,0:30:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自地狱的五万只灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}50, 000 souls from the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.53,0:30:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以带他们去天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take them up to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.54,0:30:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,示威一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make quite a showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.59,0:30:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's either this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.67,0:30:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就是再来一次天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the apocalypse all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.62,0:30:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所奋斗的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you've worked for …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.66,0:30:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及萨姆和迪恩所努力的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything that Sam and Dean has worked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.21,0:30:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,都化为乌有\N{\fnArial\fs30}gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.66,0:30:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 你可以拯救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can save us, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.35,0:30:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝选择你来救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}God chose you to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.49,0:30:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我认为 在你内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think…Deep down…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.56,0:30:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.19,0:30:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.21,0:30:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时的傲慢没有战胜自己的理智…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was clean of pride at that moment…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.23,0:30:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.94,0:31:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再有天启了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.77,0:31:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这话传出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let it be known…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.43,0:31:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟随拉斐尔 便是与我为敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're either with Raphael or you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.26,0:31:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是善意的初衷引导我走上了这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so went the long road of good intentions…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.06,0:31:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直走到今天的境地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The road that brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.37,0:31:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要借助一些你的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you for a little powwow down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.05,0:31:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so come on down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.26,0:31:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,随叫随到呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Johnny on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.69,0:31:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还没离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.73,0:31:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们得把尸体埋掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we had to bury the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.98,0:31:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还发现了一些威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we found a little whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.18,0:31:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.01,0:31:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,要帮什么忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.09,0:31:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样… 我们想了个新方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look. We, um… we have a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.58,0:31:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为这办法能够找到克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think we've finally figured out a way to track down Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.11,0:31:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么办法 - 就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.57,0:32:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这是做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.23,0:32:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.11,0:32:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈什么 放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what? Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.53,0:32:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}About superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.85,0:32:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有氪晶体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kryptonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.23,0:32:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道我说了这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.66,0:32:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你监视我们多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been watching us?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.10,0:32:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你知不知道什么人才搞监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who spies on people, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.72,0:32:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 间谍 - 等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spies. - Okay, just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.16,0:32:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道你们在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.95,0:32:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个恶魔巢穴怎么解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about this demon craphole?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.03,0:32:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it so, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.65,0:32:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,干净得跟圣所一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Next to godliness" Clean in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.79,0:32:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力又是怎么用假尸骨骗过你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how exactly did Crowley trick you with the wrong bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.59,0:32:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事很难懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.67,0:32:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.68,0:32:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去 我出去之后再…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me go. Let me out and I can…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.41,0:32:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得看着我说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to look at me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.72,0:32:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须跟我坦白 告诉我这是怎么一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to level with me and tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.27,0:32:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look me in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.50,0:32:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你没跟克劳力同流合污\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me you're not working with Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.21,0:33:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.63,0:33:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.14,0:33:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in it with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.19,0:33:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和克劳力合伙试图找到炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Crowley have been going after purgatory together?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.92,0:33:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就是了对么 一直都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have, huh? This whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.62,0:33:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么做是为了保护你 保护你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it to protect you. I did it to protect all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.92,0:33:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect us how?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.59,0:33:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开通往怪物乐园的通道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By opening a hole into monsterland!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.88,0:33:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 他说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.29,0:33:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只一瞬间 就放出了夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}One drop got through, and it was Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.22,0:33:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要把整座炼狱打开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to break down the entire dam?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.44,0:33:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了得到那些灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get the souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.31,0:33:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能阻止拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can stop Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.81,0:33:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你们必须相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.46,0:33:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.91,0:33:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在让我们怎么相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in the hell are we supposed to trust you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.22,0:33:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.66,0:33:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是你们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.09,0:33:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.58,0:33:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你从地狱里救出来的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who raised you from perdition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.36,0:33:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.14,0:33:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no offense…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.70,0:34:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这活干得可不怎么利索\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did a pretty piss-poor job of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.89,0:34:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.05,0:34:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的灵魂落在地狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring me back soulless…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.43,0:34:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有意的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.65,0:34:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会这样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.95,0:34:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我现在在想很多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm thinking a lot of things right now, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.54,0:34:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.86,0:34:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斐尔要把我们全部杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael will kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.53,0:34:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会将整个世界变成墓场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll turn the world into a graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.96,0:34:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.39,0:34:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.08,0:34:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你选错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just made the wrong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.33,0:34:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.64,0:34:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.16,0:34:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实不复杂 你自己也清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, it's not, and you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.89,0:34:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你为什么瞒着不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why else would you keep this whole thing a secret, huh,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.56,0:34:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你心里明知道这是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you knew that it was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.63,0:34:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇上这种烂事的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When crap like this comes around,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.28,0:34:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迎难而上\N{\fnArial\fs30}we deal with it…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.09,0:34:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我们一直做的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.81,0:34:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一不可行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we don't do is we don't go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.64,0:34:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是去跟那魔鬼做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make another deal with the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.38,0:35:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样讲出来好像很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds so simple when you say it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.59,0:35:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我需要听人忠告的时候你在哪里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you when I needed to hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.47,0:35:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.62,0:35:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.37,0:35:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该找我们帮忙的 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've come to us for help, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.68,0:35:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.84,0:35:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在为时已晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.80,0:35:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能现在放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.32,0:35:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.98,0:35:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.49,0:35:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 小卡 我们能弥补这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Cass! We can fix this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.12,0:35:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这没什么可补的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's not broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.42,0:35:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.42,0:35:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快走 走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to run now! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.99,0:36:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.59,0:36:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,又在玩火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing with fire again?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.93,0:36:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你敢碰温氏兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you touch the winchesters…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.37,0:36:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早听你说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I heard you the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.82,0:36:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 他们狡猾的小脑袋上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise … nary a hair on their.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.82,0:36:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一根毛都不会少\N{\fnArial\fs30}artfully tousled heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.23,0:36:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了 我想他们印证了我的观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I think they've proven my point for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.07,0:36:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,到头来总是因为那些朋友 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always your friends, isn't it, in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.12,0:36:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尝试改变 尝试改进自身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We try to change. We try to improve ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.58,0:36:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但总有那么些个朋友抓着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always our friends who got to claw into our sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.00,0:37:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止我们的前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hold us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.20,0:37:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我看到了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what I see here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.20,0:37:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,新一任上帝和魔鬼 进行合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new god and the new devil, working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.44,0:37:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.83,0:37:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.15,0:37:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我眼前消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.54,0:37:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.06,0:37:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.68,0:37:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 不用客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道咱们俩之间的区别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the difference between you and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.86,0:37:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.23,0:37:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是什么 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.60,0:37:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟想做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you willing to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.95,0:38:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.75,0:38:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.55,0:38:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比在房子上画的那些天使防护阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel-proofing Bobby put up on the house …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.40,0:38:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几处画错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got a few things wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.76,0:38:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜我们居然还要防着你 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's too bad we got to angel-proof in the first place, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.63,0:38:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.92,0:38:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.36,0:38:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, believe me, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.10,0:38:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了打败拉斐尔神马的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah, blah, Raphael, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.85,0:38:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是为了你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this for you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.52,0:38:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你我才这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.17,0:38:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of me. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.03,0:38:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逗我玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.09,0:38:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你让我了解了自由和自由意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who taught me that freedom and free will …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.32,0:38:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太幼稚了 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a freakin' child, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.48,0:39:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为你无所不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you can do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.43,0:39:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以无所不顾其极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean that you get to do whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.17,0:39:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我在干什么 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'm doing, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.93,0:39:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会跟你讲道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna logic you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.08,0:39:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求你别那么做 没有为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying don't… Just 'cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.81,0:39:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你去做 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you not to. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.22,0:39:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.38,0:39:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, next to Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.56,0:39:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和鲍比就是最像我亲人的家伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Bobby are the closest things I have to family …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.33,0:39:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像是我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you are like a brother to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.36,0:39:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 当我不想让你去做什么的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if I'm asking you not to do something…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.81,0:39:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就应该听我的 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}…You got to trust me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.37,0:39:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.37,0:39:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就要尽一切努力阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll have to do what I have to do to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.36,0:39:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.20,0:39:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.27,0:39:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.14,0:39:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜不准 可我也干掉过一些大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I've taken some pretty big fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.70,0:40:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也对不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry, too, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.86,0:40:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是一切原委\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.42,0:40:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这就是你所谓的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it's what you would call a…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.74,0:40:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,从人类角度来看 是场悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tragedy from the human perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.18,0:40:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许人类的目光不那么深远\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe the human perspective is…Limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.80,0:40:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.08,0:40:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我来问你了 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm asking you, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.47,0:40:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.17,0:40:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I doing the right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.21,0:40:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选的道路对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I on the right path?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.78,0:40:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.95,0:40:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给我一个提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to give me…A sign.
